						 <p>I liked this a whole lot more than I thought I would.</p> <p>I mean, Decibelle's probably right, and you could likely improve the horror and the characterization and the complexity of the narrative, and upvoting stuff like this is going to lose me my Harsh Reputation, but the reality is that I am a ridiculously easy sell; all you need to do is entertain me, and I'm in. And this entertained me.</p> 
