				<wikidot:authorName>Decibelles</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2005044</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I feel like this would work much better from a character perspective than the way it's presented here. As it is, it's&#8230; not conveying the horror well, and honestly kind of boring.</p> <p><span style="font-size:50%;">remember if you stay up extremely tired and sleep deprived you too can think youre reading a site tale when youre actually looking at an early sandbox draft</span></p> <p>EDIT: Eh, I'm still gonna have to go with a downvote here. You're not hitting what you try to aim for, I feel like, and though it was a promising start, it just doesn't feel strong enough at all to support the concept, and just collapses at the end.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
